 °±²Û DESCRIPTION Û²±°

  Turn your phone into a Game Boy Camera. Take a photo, pick a face-melting
  effect, and print it on a thermal cat printer. Smear yourself with Power
  Goo, add a scroll border, or print a wanted poster for the biscuit thief.

  Play real Game Boy and Game Boy Color games in the built-in emulator and
  print their screens. Make mazes, sudoku, name badges, QR codes, colouring
  pages and old school ANSI art that prints 1:1 sideways down the paper.

 °±²Û FEATURES Û²±°

  ş 48+ camera effects, from halftone to hyperspace
  ş Game Boy Camera look with real 4-shade dithering
  ş Photo booth strips, stickers, scrolls, badges
  ş Real Game Boy Printer protocol support
  ş Kid mode with a parent PIN and a paper budget
  ş This very NFO, rendered with a real VGA font

 °±²Û INSTALL NOTES Û²±°

  1. Open the page in Chrome on Android.
  2. Tap Connect and pick your printer.
  3. If it prints garbage, set chunk bytes to 20.
  4. Print something silly. Stick it on the fridge.

 °±²Û GREETZ Û²±°

